  "givingScope": "Ordinary organizational gift represented by its dominant All Babies Are Equal vaccination-incentive platform. No geographic restriction or special new donor product. Explicit marginal core allocation prior; noncore health uncredited, not known zero.",
  "giftUsd": 10000,
  "unit": "One eligible infant in a supported clinic catchment, whether or not enrolled/completing. Cost is analyst all-in cash per catchment infant, NOT sourced price per unique enrolled child.",
